      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Recently made a method to do low-quality lip sync using a modified/stripped down version of audiolink. The character's voice is transmitted using a stream, so I needed real-time lip sync. Would've been way easier with a normal lip sync asset!\n\nAt some point OVRLipSync components were whitelisted and later removed from the whitelist. (it's not in the documentation any more) So it seems like this ticket is relevant again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
