  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For adding lip sync to NPCs in worlds easily, a component such as SALSA would be very useful.  It is extremely easy to set up if your NPC is a VRChat-ready avatar.  https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/animation/salsa-with-randomeyes-16944",
